Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.77,0:00:05.77,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0\pos(966.893,127.223)}{\fad(200,200)\pos(970.893,187.223)}翻译/压制/字幕制作：HAF半个水果
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.56,0:00:10.56,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0\pos(968.894,899.223)}{\fad(200,200)\pos(967.56,109.89)\fs77}使用AI工具翻译，如有不准确的地方请在弹幕或评论区指正，谢谢！
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.64,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}朋友们 你们好
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.64,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Hello, friends.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.80,0:00:03.08,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我叫Adrian 和我一起的是Jerry
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.80,0:00:03.08,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}My name is Adrian and I'm joined by Jerry.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.44,0:00:08.30,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这周我们要聊的是C418创作的 Minecraft Volume Alpha
Dialogue: 2,0:00:03.44,0:00:08.30,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}And this week we are doing Minecraft Volume Alpha by C418.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.70,0:00:11.54,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这大概是最具标志性的配乐之一
Dialogue: 2,0:00:08.70,0:00:11.54,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Probably one of the most iconic soundtracks,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.86,0:00:13.28,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}可以说是游戏配乐中的经典
Dialogue: 2,0:00:11.86,0:00:13.28,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}full stop gaming soundtracks,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.44,0:00:14.62,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}属于有史以来最热门的游戏之一
Dialogue: 2,0:00:13.44,0:00:14.62,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}one of the most popular games ever.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.96,0:00:17.94,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}你对《我的世界》或者它的配乐了解多少？
Dialogue: 2,0:00:14.96,0:00:17.94,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}What do you know about Minecraft slash the soundtrack?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.46,0:00:18.60,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}好吧
Dialogue: 2,0:00:18.46,0:00:18.60,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.64,0:00:22.14,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}嗯 《我的世界》 我算是低调的专家
Dialogue: 2,0:00:18.64,0:00:22.14,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Well Minecraft, I'm low-key an expert in Minecraft.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.54,0:00:25.34,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}疫情期间我在线远程修了一门课
Dialogue: 2,0:00:22.54,0:00:25.34,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}During covid I took a class in it remotely online
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.34,0:00:29.78,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这样我就能让学生们创建世界 并通过它展示他们的学习成果
Dialogue: 2,0:00:25.34,0:00:29.78,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}so that I could get my students making worlds and demonstrating their learning through it.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.78,0:00:31.04,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}然后我就彻底迷上了
Dialogue: 2,0:00:29.78,0:00:31.04,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}And I got really into it.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.12,0:00:33.64,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我们做了几个项目 后来就停了
Dialogue: 2,0:00:31.12,0:00:33.64,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}We did a couple projects and then I just kind of stopped.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.96,0:00:36.06,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}但不管怎样 回到音乐部分
Dialogue: 2,0:00:33.96,0:00:36.06,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}But anyways, back to the music part.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.14,0:00:37.02,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}所以我听过那些音乐
Dialogue: 2,0:00:36.14,0:00:37.02,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}So I've heard the music,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.16,0:00:42.94,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}其中一些 但你提到我们要做这个之前我从来没想过 我当时很困惑
Dialogue: 2,0:00:37.16,0:00:42.94,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}some of it, but I never thought about it until you mentioned we were doing this and I was very confused.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.18,0:00:46.80,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}是的 这算是个出人意料的选择 但可能会很有趣
Dialogue: 2,0:00:44.18,0:00:46.80,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah, it's kind of a left field pick but could be fun.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.54,0:00:48.96,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我的意思是 我从小就一直在玩《我的世界》
Dialogue: 2,0:00:47.54,0:00:48.96,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I mean, I've been playing Minecraft since I was a kid.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.02,0:00:50.14,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我有时还会玩
Dialogue: 2,0:00:49.02,0:00:50.14,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Like I still play it sometimes.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.26,0:00:51.42,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我主要玩Bed Wars
Dialogue: 2,0:00:50.26,0:00:51.42,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I play mainly Bed Wars.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.70,0:00:53.56,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}那是一个服务器上的小游戏
Dialogue: 2,0:00:51.70,0:00:53.56,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}It's like a mini game on like a server.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:53.92,0:00:55.42,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}总之 我很多朋友都在玩
Dialogue: 2,0:00:53.92,0:00:55.42,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Anyways, a lot of my friends play it.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.54,0:00:56.96,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我可能需要重新玩起来
Dialogue: 2,0:00:55.54,0:00:56.96,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I may need to get back into it.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.76,0:00:58.78,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Bed Wars听起来很有趣
Dialogue: 2,0:00:57.76,0:00:58.78,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Bed Wars sounds fun.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.78,0:00:59.88,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Bed Wars超好玩的
Dialogue: 2,0:00:58.78,0:00:59.88,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Bed Wars is so much fun.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.96,0:01:01.28,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}有点像夺旗模式那种
Dialogue: 2,0:00:59.96,0:01:01.28,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}It's like Capture the Flag kind of.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.42,0:01:03.40,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}但是是在床上 对吧？
Dialogue: 2,0:01:01.42,0:01:03.40,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}But in bed, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:04.10,0:01:05.66,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}不 你是要保护你的床
Dialogue: 2,0:01:04.10,0:01:05.66,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}No, you're like defending your bed.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.80,0:01:06.96,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}就像你的睡觉的地方？
Dialogue: 2,0:01:05.80,0:01:06.96,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Like your sleeping quarters?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.34,0:01:11.38,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}不……我觉得床只是一个代表生命的东西
Dialogue: 2,0:01:07.34,0:01:11.38,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}No, it's... I think the bed is just like a placeholder for the thing that gives you life.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.64,0:01:12.90,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}比如如果你失去了你的床
Dialogue: 2,0:01:11.64,0:01:12.90,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Like if you lose your bed,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.98,0:01:13.70,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}你就不能重生了
Dialogue: 2,0:01:12.98,0:01:13.70,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}you don't respawn.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.94,0:01:14.68,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我没有太多话要说
Dialogue: 2,0:01:13.94,0:01:14.68,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I don't have tons to say.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.76,0:01:16.74,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我是说 这只是一段舒缓的背景音乐
Dialogue: 2,0:01:14.76,0:01:16.74,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I mean, it's just a mellow soundtrack.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.86,0:01:18.20,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这对我们来说会有所不同
Dialogue: 2,0:01:16.86,0:01:18.20,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}It's gonna be something different for us,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.30,0:01:18.90,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}对于这个频道来说
Dialogue: 2,0:01:18.30,0:01:18.90,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}for the channel.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.08,0:01:22.90,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}像往常一样 完整版和其他内容都在我们的Patreon上
Dialogue: 2,0:01:19.08,0:01:22.90,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}As always, the full version is on our Patreon along with other things.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.14,0:01:24.46,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我们先从前两首曲目开始
Dialogue: 2,0:01:23.14,0:01:24.46,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}We'll start with the first two tracks.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.58,0:01:27.22,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}所以第一首曲目是Key 第二首曲目是Door
Dialogue: 2,0:01:24.58,0:01:27.22,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}So the first track is Key and the second track is Door.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.43,0:01:32.25,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}注意到了手钟
Dialogue: 2,0:01:30.43,0:01:32.25,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Remind me of handbells.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.89,0:01:34.49,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}是的 我的孩子们会玩它们
Dialogue: 2,0:01:32.89,0:01:34.49,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah, my kids play them.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.86,0:01:42.56,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}但就像在洞穴或什么地方
Dialogue: 2,0:01:39.86,0:01:42.56,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}But like in like a cavern or something,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.96,0:01:44.18,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}就像很远的地方
Dialogue: 2,0:01:42.96,0:01:44.18,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}like really far away.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.42,0:01:44.92,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}而且是数字的
Dialogue: 2,0:01:44.42,0:01:44.92,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}And digital.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.22,0:01:49.08,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}问题是对于很多这些歌
Dialogue: 2,0:01:47.22,0:01:49.08,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}The problem is with a lot of these songs,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.14,0:01:50.64,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我只是想象在玩游戏
Dialogue: 2,0:01:49.14,0:01:50.64,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I just picture playing the game,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.04,0:01:52.44,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}你知道 就像我会在做什么
Dialogue: 2,0:01:51.04,0:01:52.44,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}you know, and like what I'd be doing.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.32,0:01:55.56,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}对我来说 这感觉有点不舒服
Dialogue: 2,0:01:53.32,0:01:55.56,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}To me, this feels uncomfortable a little bit.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.47,0:02:12.71,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}那是个不错的合成器
Dialogue: 2,0:02:11.47,0:02:12.71,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}That's a nice synth.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.91,0:02:16.41,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我有一些关于Door的问题
Dialogue: 2,0:02:14.91,0:02:16.41,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I have some questions about Door.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.55,0:02:22.13,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}有多少乐器是真实演奏的 又有多少是通过电脑人工生成的？
Dialogue: 2,0:02:16.55,0:02:22.13,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}How many of the instruments are actually real and how much of it is just artificially generated through computer?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.29,0:02:23.33,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}人们可能会纠正我这一点
Dialogue: 2,0:02:22.29,0:02:23.33,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}People could correct me on this,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.41,0:02:26.99,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}但我很确定这完全是在电脑里完成的
Dialogue: 2,0:02:23.41,0:02:26.99,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}but I'm pretty sure it's completely done in like a computer.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.33,0:02:27.61,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}好的
Dialogue: 2,0:02:27.33,0:02:27.61,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.93,0:02:29.11,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}也许有些钢琴是真实的
Dialogue: 2,0:02:27.93,0:02:29.11,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Maybe some of the piano is real.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.23,0:02:31.25,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我不知道 但它有那种感觉
Dialogue: 2,0:02:29.23,0:02:31.25,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I don't know, but it has that feeling.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.39,0:02:32.33,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}它确实有那种感觉
Dialogue: 2,0:02:31.39,0:02:32.33,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}It does have that feeling.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.67,0:02:33.89,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}钢琴 我在想
Dialogue: 2,0:02:32.67,0:02:33.89,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}The piano, I was wondering,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.13,0:02:38.81,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}它一开始有种日本的感觉 只是因为音符的敲击方式
Dialogue: 2,0:02:34.13,0:02:38.81,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}it starts off it kind of Japanese feeling just because of the way the notes are struck.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.95,0:02:42.31,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我们有点知道这种情况可能会在原声带的不同部分出现
Dialogue: 2,0:02:38.95,0:02:42.31,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}We kind of knew that this might happen at different parts in this soundtrack,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.45,0:02:44.41,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}并不是说我以前没听过这个原声带
Dialogue: 2,0:02:42.45,0:02:44.41,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}not that I've never listened to the soundtrack before,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.51,0:02:46.71,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}而是我们可能不知道该说些什么
Dialogue: 2,0:02:44.51,0:02:46.71,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}but that we might not know what the hell to say.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.97,0:02:49.93,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这可能是那种我们得在播放过程中或期间说话的事情
Dialogue: 2,0:02:46.97,0:02:49.93,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}It might be one of those things where we have to talk through or during.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.21,0:02:51.61,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我们继续到第三首曲目
Dialogue: 2,0:02:50.21,0:02:51.61,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}We'll move on to track three,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.85,0:02:53.75,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}也就是Subwoofer Lullaby
Dialogue: 2,0:02:51.85,0:02:53.75,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}which is Subwoofer Lullaby.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.72,0:03:15.98,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我的大脑好奇这在游戏中会如何使用
Dialogue: 2,0:03:13.72,0:03:15.98,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}My brain wonders how this would be used in the game.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.62,0:03:17.48,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}你会做什么？
Dialogue: 2,0:03:16.62,0:03:17.48,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}What would you be doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.18,0:03:21.74,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}你只会悲伤地看着自己造的一堵墙吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:03:19.18,0:03:21.74,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}You'd just be sadly looking at one of the walls you created?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.50,0:03:26.10,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我觉得它就像随便什么时候播放一样
Dialogue: 2,0:03:24.50,0:03:26.10,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I think it just plays like whenever,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.24,0:03:26.56,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}比如……
Dialogue: 2,0:03:26.24,0:03:26.56,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}like...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.30,0:03:33.24,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}你可能在挖矿 拜访村民
Dialogue: 2,0:03:28.30,0:03:33.24,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}You could be mining, visiting villagers.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.64,0:03:42.08,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我可能是错的 但我觉得某些歌曲不是由你所做的事触发的
Dialogue: 2,0:03:37.64,0:03:42.08,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I could be wrong, but I don't think certain songs are triggered by what you're doing.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:42.30,0:03:42.60,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}好吧
Dialogue: 2,0:03:42.30,0:03:42.60,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.46,0:03:47.48,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}非常氛围化
Dialogue: 2,0:03:46.46,0:03:47.48,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Very ambient.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.13,0:03:57.93,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}但几乎像是一种启迪类的管风琴音乐
Dialogue: 2,0:03:50.13,0:03:57.93,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}But almost like enlightenment kind of organ music.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.67,0:04:02.19,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我听到很多 重新听一下这个
Dialogue: 2,0:03:58.67,0:04:02.19,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I get a lot, just listen to this again,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.29,0:04:05.29,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}比如Brian Eno 他那类氛围音乐
Dialogue: 2,0:04:02.29,0:04:05.29,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}like Brian Eno, his like ambient stuff.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:05.79,0:04:09.15,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}在Dora上 我听到了像是90年代的John Tesh
Dialogue: 2,0:04:05.79,0:04:09.15,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}On Dora, I was picking up like John Tesh from the 90s,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:09.39,0:04:10.39,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}那个弹钢琴的家伙
Dialogue: 2,0:04:09.39,0:04:10.39,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}the piano guy.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:12.97,0:04:14.83,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}不过我喜欢好听的钢琴
Dialogue: 2,0:04:12.97,0:04:14.83,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I love me a nice piano though.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:17.39,0:04:19.65,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}它有种让人踏实的感觉 把你拉回当下
Dialogue: 2,0:04:17.39,0:04:19.65,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Something grounding about it brings you back.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:20.69,0:04:23.43,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这会是一张完美的冥想专辑
Dialogue: 2,0:04:20.69,0:04:23.43,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}This would be a perfect meditation album.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.87,0:04:26.91,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}闭上眼睛 盘腿坐下
Dialogue: 2,0:04:23.87,0:04:26.91,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Closed eyes, sit, crisscross applesauce,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.19,0:04:28.47,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}什么都不想 冥想
Dialogue: 2,0:04:27.19,0:04:28.47,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}think about nothing and meditate.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:28.79,0:04:30.95,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我觉得下次我就要用它来冥想
Dialogue: 2,0:04:28.79,0:04:30.95,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I think actually I'm going to use this for that next time.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:31.13,0:04:35.77,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}实际上我在做作业或写论文的时候很喜欢用这张专辑
Dialogue: 2,0:04:31.13,0:04:35.77,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I actually like use this album a lot when I was like working on assignments or writing papers.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.91,0:04:38.15,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我发现它对提高效率非常有用
Dialogue: 2,0:04:35.91,0:04:38.15,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I find it incredible for being productive.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.53,0:04:39.71,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}比如如果我在做 举个例子
Dialogue: 2,0:04:38.53,0:04:39.71,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Like if I'm doing, like for example,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:39.77,0:04:41.33,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}如果我在为我们编辑缩略图
Dialogue: 2,0:04:39.77,0:04:41.33,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}if I'm editing thumbnails for us,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:41.41,0:04:43.19,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我会放着氛围音乐
Dialogue: 2,0:04:41.41,0:04:43.19,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I'll have like ambient music on.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:43.41,0:04:44.53,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}它让我完全沉浸其中
Dialogue: 2,0:04:43.41,0:04:44.53,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}It just gets me locked in.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.73,0:04:45.31,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}那太酷了
Dialogue: 2,0:04:44.73,0:04:45.31,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}That's so cool.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.47,0:04:46.67,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我们这里连续来三首曲子
Dialogue: 2,0:04:45.47,0:04:46.67,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}We'll do a three track run here.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:46.79,0:04:48.07,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}第四首Death
Dialogue: 2,0:04:46.79,0:04:48.07,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}We got track four, Death,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:48.27,0:04:49.73,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}第五首Living Mice
Dialogue: 2,0:04:48.27,0:04:49.73,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}track five, Living Mice,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:49.87,0:04:51.39,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}还有第六首Moog City
Dialogue: 2,0:04:49.87,0:04:51.39,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}and track six, Moog City.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:07.58,0:05:09.68,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}那会让我暂时无法高效工作
Dialogue: 2,0:05:07.58,0:05:09.68,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}That would make me unproductive temporarily.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:13.30,0:05:14.84,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}你只是杀了一只鸭子什么的？
Dialogue: 2,0:05:13.30,0:05:14.84,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}You just kill a duck or something?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:15.04,0:05:16.32,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我觉得是只鸡
Dialogue: 2,0:05:15.04,0:05:16.32,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I think a chicken.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.06,0:06:01.20,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我喜欢这段
Dialogue: 2,0:06:00.06,0:06:01.20,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I like this build.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.02,0:06:16.76,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}关于事物也会变得平淡
Dialogue: 2,0:06:15.02,0:06:16.76,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Of how things go flat too.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:18.70,0:06:19.68,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}最后一首也是
Dialogue: 2,0:06:18.70,0:06:19.68,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Last song too.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:27.55,0:06:29.45,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}其实这里有很多事情在发生
Dialogue: 2,0:06:27.55,0:06:29.45,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}There's actually a lot of stuff going on.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:29.91,0:06:32.99,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}就像有很多小乐器进进出出
Dialogue: 2,0:06:29.91,0:06:32.99,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Like there's a lot of little instruments that come in and out.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:35.27,0:06:37.89,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我一直觉得我们得回顾一下Boards of Canada
Dialogue: 2,0:06:35.27,0:06:37.89,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}The whole time I'm thinking we have to review Boards of Canada.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:42.71,0:06:44.33,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}那会是个很好的选择
Dialogue: 2,0:06:42.71,0:06:44.33,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}That would be a really good one to do.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:46.11,0:06:47.23,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}他们属于同一类风格
Dialogue: 2,0:06:46.11,0:06:47.23,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}They're in the same wheelhouse.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:47.39,0:06:48.31,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}他们有相同的灵感
Dialogue: 2,0:06:47.39,0:06:48.31,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}They have the same inspo.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:54.86,0:06:55.98,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}不过我在想
Dialogue: 2,0:06:54.86,0:06:55.98,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I'm wondering though,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:56.40,0:06:59.54,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}如果他只是在制作它
Dialogue: 2,0:06:56.40,0:06:59.54,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}if he is just producing it,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:59.76,0:07:01.82,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}一边演奏一边即兴 还是说他真的在写谱子
Dialogue: 2,0:06:59.76,0:07:01.82,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}playing as he goes, or if he's actually like writing it out,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.92,0:07:02.72,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}比如写总谱
Dialogue: 2,0:07:01.92,0:07:02.72,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}like writing the score.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:03.12,0:07:04.60,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我想你可以两者都做
Dialogue: 2,0:07:03.12,0:07:04.60,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I guess you could do either,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:04.80,0:07:07.74,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}但是有些部分实在太复杂了 就像是
Dialogue: 2,0:07:04.80,0:07:07.74,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}but some of it's just so intricate that it's like,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:07.76,0:07:09.14,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}他是画出来的吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:07:07.76,0:07:09.14,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}did he draw it?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.18,0:07:09.58,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我不知道
Dialogue: 2,0:07:09.18,0:07:09.58,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I don't know.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.92,0:07:10.68,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}大家 告诉我们吧
Dialogue: 2,0:07:09.92,0:07:10.68,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}People, let us know.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:10.80,0:07:11.34,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我很好奇
Dialogue: 2,0:07:10.80,0:07:11.34,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I'm curious.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:11.76,0:07:13.80,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我完全不知道该说什么
Dialogue: 2,0:07:11.76,0:07:13.80,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I wouldn't know the first thing to say about that.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:14.46,0:07:16.32,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}但这感觉像是瑞典的Hagström
Dialogue: 2,0:07:14.46,0:07:16.32,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}But this feels Swedish Hagström.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:16.94,0:07:19.06,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}到目前为止 这听起来真的很平静
Dialogue: 2,0:07:16.94,0:07:19.06,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}This is a really peaceful listen so far.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:19.08,0:07:19.56,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}是的 确实是
Dialogue: 2,0:07:19.08,0:07:19.56,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:19.74,0:07:19.92,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}是的
Dialogue: 2,0:07:19.74,0:07:19.92,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:19.92,0:07:22.82,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我觉得我们应该多说点什么
Dialogue: 2,0:07:19.92,0:07:22.82,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I feel like we should be saying more stuff about it.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.90,0:07:23.74,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我只是……
Dialogue: 2,0:07:22.90,0:07:23.74,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I just...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:23.74,0:07:24.30,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}是的 很难说
Dialogue: 2,0:07:23.74,0:07:24.30,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah, it's hard to.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.68,0:07:25.68,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}确实有点难说
Dialogue: 2,0:07:24.68,0:07:25.68,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}It is kind of hard to.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:25.96,0:07:28.44,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}好吧 我们可以做接下来的两首
Dialogue: 2,0:07:25.96,0:07:28.44,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Well, we can do the next two,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:28.62,0:07:30.78,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}第七首 Hagström
Dialogue: 2,0:07:28.62,0:07:30.78,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}which are track 7, Hagström,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.94,0:07:32.46,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}和第八首Minecraft
Dialogue: 2,0:07:30.94,0:07:32.46,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}and track 8, Minecraft.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:34.20,0:07:36.22,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这是那种和你……有关的小东西之一吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:07:34.20,0:07:36.22,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Is this one of those little things with your...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:37.12,0:07:37.56,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}马林巴琴？
Dialogue: 2,0:07:37.12,0:07:37.56,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Marimba?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:37.80,0:07:38.46,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}不 不是马林巴琴
Dialogue: 2,0:07:37.80,0:07:38.46,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}No, not Marimba.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:39.00,0:07:40.36,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}是啊 我不知道
Dialogue: 2,0:07:39.00,0:07:40.36,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah, I don't know.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:40.42,0:07:41.24,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我忘了那叫什么了
Dialogue: 2,0:07:40.42,0:07:41.24,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I forget what that's called.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.34,0:07:45.40,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}会有人知道的
Dialogue: 2,0:07:44.34,0:07:45.40,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Someone will know.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.04,0:07:53.96,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}不过话说回来 很多音符听起来像是画进去的
Dialogue: 2,0:07:50.04,0:07:53.96,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Then again, a lot of these notes sound like they're drawn in,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:53.96,0:07:58.42,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}就像……不是有人在演奏 因为完全没有错误
Dialogue: 2,0:07:53.96,0:07:58.42,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}like they're like... someone's not playing them because there's like no mistakes.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.94,0:07:59.86,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}就像一切都非常
Dialogue: 2,0:07:58.94,0:07:59.86,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Like it's all like very,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:00.36,0:08:01.08,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}你懂的……
Dialogue: 2,0:08:00.36,0:08:01.08,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}you know...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:01.88,0:08:02.76,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}数字世界
Dialogue: 2,0:08:01.88,0:08:02.76,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Digital world.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:03.18,0:08:05.60,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}是啊 就像他画了进去 然后电脑在播放它们
Dialogue: 2,0:08:03.18,0:08:05.60,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah, like he drew them in and the computer's playing them.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:06.72,0:08:07.78,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}可能又错了
Dialogue: 2,0:08:06.72,0:08:07.78,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Could be wrong again,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.86,0:08:08.16,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}但是……
Dialogue: 2,0:08:07.86,0:08:08.16,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}but...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:16.53,0:08:19.25,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这符合你玩《我的世界》时的氛围吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:08:16.53,0:08:19.25,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Does this fit the vibe of you playing Minecraft?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:19.81,0:08:22.15,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}就是说 是这个氛围吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:08:19.81,0:08:22.15,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Like, is this the vibe?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.19,0:08:24.65,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}有点诡异和空旷
Dialogue: 2,0:08:22.19,0:08:24.65,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}It's kind of a little bit eerie and spacey.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.33,0:08:25.59,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}是的
Dialogue: 2,0:08:25.33,0:08:25.59,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.89,0:08:29.99,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fs75}我是说 我觉得确实 因为至少在原声带里 它在里面的时候不是这样的
Dialogue: 2,0:08:25.89,0:08:29.99,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I mean, I think it does because it's not like in at least the soundtrack when it's in there.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:29.99,0:08:31.59,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}它并不……不会太喧宾夺主
Dialogue: 2,0:08:29.99,0:08:31.59,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}It doesn't... it's not overpowering.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:31.65,0:08:32.73,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}就像它更多是在背景里
Dialogue: 2,0:08:31.65,0:08:32.73,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Like it's more in the background.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:32.95,0:08:36.41,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}而且显然有很多背景……或者说不算是背景
Dialogue: 2,0:08:32.95,0:08:36.41,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}And there's obviously like tons of background... or not background.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:36.99,0:08:39.01,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}可能又错了
Dialogue: 2,0:08:36.99,0:08:39.01,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Tons of sound effects of you playing the game,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.09,0:08:39.95,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}比如走来走去
Dialogue: 2,0:08:39.09,0:08:39.95,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}like walking around.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.41,0:08:42.17,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}所以它就有点像叠加在那之上
Dialogue: 2,0:08:40.41,0:08:42.17,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}So it kind of is like over top of that.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.51,0:08:44.07,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}好的 所以它并不是那么突出
Dialogue: 2,0:08:42.51,0:08:44.07,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Okay, so this is not front and center.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.17,0:08:46.43,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这真的就是在背景里
Dialogue: 2,0:08:44.17,0:08:46.43,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}This is like literally in the background.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:46.81,0:08:48.37,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}是的 我是说 我觉得你可以调整它
Dialogue: 2,0:08:46.81,0:08:48.37,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah, I mean, I think you can adjust it.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:48.41,0:08:49.09,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}但大多数情况下
Dialogue: 2,0:08:48.41,0:08:49.09,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}But for the most part,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:49.11,0:08:52.75,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我觉得游戏里其他的音效比原声带响很多
Dialogue: 2,0:08:49.11,0:08:52.75,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I think the other sound effects in the game are much louder than the soundtrack.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:52.87,0:08:54.45,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}所以它更像是背景里若隐若现的那种
Dialogue: 2,0:08:52.87,0:08:54.45,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}So it's more like subtle in the background.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:54.91,0:08:56.79,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}有些我都不记得游戏里有
Dialogue: 2,0:08:54.91,0:08:56.79,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Some of them like I don't remember from the game,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:56.91,0:08:58.59,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}不过有些确实很突出 就像那一段
Dialogue: 2,0:08:56.91,0:08:58.59,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}which like certain ones stick out like that one.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:58.59,0:09:00.27,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我记得还有几个 我也不记得了
Dialogue: 2,0:08:58.59,0:09:00.27,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I remember a couple other ones like I didn't.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.39,0:09:01.63,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}哦 我不该停掉那个的
Dialogue: 2,0:09:00.39,0:09:01.63,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Oh, I wasn't supposed to stop that one.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:01.79,0:09:02.23,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}对 你确实不该
Dialogue: 2,0:09:01.79,0:09:02.23,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}No, you weren't.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:02.47,0:09:04.49,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}是的 那我就再开一个三曲连播
Dialogue: 2,0:09:02.47,0:09:04.49,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah, I'll just start another three track run.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:04.71,0:09:09.51,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这是第八首 第九首是Oxygen 第十首是Equinox
Dialogue: 2,0:09:04.71,0:09:09.51,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}This is track eight and then track nine is Oxygen and track ten is Equinox.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:24.58,0:09:25.76,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}你认得这段吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:09:24.58,0:09:25.76,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Do you recognize this?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:30.08,0:09:31.18,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}嗯 我觉得认得
Dialogue: 2,0:09:30.08,0:09:31.18,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah, I think so.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:31.64,0:09:33.62,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}已经……已经差不多
Dialogue: 2,0:09:31.64,0:09:33.62,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}It's been... it's been almost,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:33.76,0:09:35.04,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}嗯 五年没玩了
Dialogue: 2,0:09:33.76,0:09:35.04,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}yeah, five years since I played.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:37.24,0:09:38.64,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}但我觉得认得
Dialogue: 2,0:09:37.24,0:09:38.64,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}But I think so.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:38.80,0:09:40.16,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这段感觉很熟悉
Dialogue: 2,0:09:38.80,0:09:40.16,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}This feels familiar.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:44.50,0:09:46.72,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这不是那种典型的电子游戏配乐
Dialogue: 2,0:09:44.50,0:09:46.72,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}It's not your typical video game soundtrack.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:47.28,0:09:48.08,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}慢多了
Dialogue: 2,0:09:47.28,0:09:48.08,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Way slower.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.92,0:09:51.22,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}对 更氛围感 更空旷
Dialogue: 2,0:09:48.92,0:09:51.22,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah, much more ambient and spacious.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:54.68,0:09:57.32,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}嗯 因为我觉得《我的世界》大多时候就是很放松
Dialogue: 2,0:09:54.68,0:09:57.32,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Well, because I guess a lot of Minecraft is just chill.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:57.42,0:09:59.18,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}就像你可以随便玩玩 放空自己
Dialogue: 2,0:09:57.42,0:09:59.18,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Like you can just play it and be chill.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:59.28,0:10:00.34,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}它并不是特别……
Dialogue: 2,0:09:59.28,0:10:00.34,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Like it's not super...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:02.58,0:10:03.42,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}怎么说来着？
Dialogue: 2,0:10:02.58,0:10:03.42,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}What's the, what's the term?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:03.48,0:10:04.30,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}它是沙盒游戏
Dialogue: 2,0:10:03.48,0:10:04.30,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}It's a sandbox game.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:04.36,0:10:05.42,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}所以你想干嘛就干嘛
Dialogue: 2,0:10:04.36,0:10:05.42,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}So you kind of just do whatever,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:05.70,0:10:06.56,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}懂吧？
Dialogue: 2,0:10:05.70,0:10:06.56,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}you know?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:06.76,0:10:07.74,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}你看电影了吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:10:06.76,0:10:07.74,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Did you watch the movie?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:10.14,0:10:11.24,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我觉得没有
Dialogue: 2,0:10:10.14,0:10:11.24,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:11.40,0:10:12.50,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}可能跟我孩子看过吧
Dialogue: 2,0:10:11.40,0:10:12.50,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Maybe with my kids.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:13.34,0:10:14.12,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我不太确定
Dialogue: 2,0:10:13.34,0:10:14.12,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I don't know.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:14.26,0:10:15.68,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我看过太多儿童电影了
Dialogue: 2,0:10:14.26,0:10:15.68,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I've seen so many kids movies.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:16.26,0:10:16.90,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}那也是
Dialogue: 2,0:10:16.26,0:10:16.90,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}That's true.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:18.94,0:10:20.20,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我觉得我没看过
Dialogue: 2,0:10:18.94,0:10:20.20,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I don't think I did.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:22.42,0:10:23.76,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}里面有蝙蝠侠吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:10:22.42,0:10:23.76,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Was Batman in it?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:24.98,0:10:25.72,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}没有 那是另一部电影
Dialogue: 2,0:10:24.98,0:10:25.72,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}No, that was something else.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.68,0:10:27.76,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}那是《乐高大电影》
Dialogue: 2,0:10:26.68,0:10:27.76,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}That's the Lego movie,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:27.84,0:10:28.16,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我觉得
Dialogue: 2,0:10:27.84,0:10:28.16,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I think.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:28.34,0:10:28.86,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}对 就是这个
Dialogue: 2,0:10:28.34,0:10:28.86,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}That's it.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:29.08,0:10:30.36,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}别的积木 别的积木
Dialogue: 2,0:10:29.08,0:10:30.36,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Other blocks, other blocks.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:36.18,0:10:38.46,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}一些 《我的世界》专家
Dialogue: 2,0:10:36.18,0:10:38.46,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Some expert in Minecraft.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:41.96,0:10:45.18,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我老是走神 就像在我的白日梦世界里一样
Dialogue: 2,0:10:41.96,0:10:45.18,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I keep getting lost, like in my daydream world.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:57.79,0:10:58.79,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}很放松
Dialogue: 2,0:10:57.79,0:10:58.79,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}It's very chill.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:32.23,0:11:34.23,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}绝对是这部剧的另外一集
Dialogue: 2,0:11:32.23,0:11:34.23,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Definitely a different episode of the show.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:34.43,0:11:35.07,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}是啊 挺酷的
Dialogue: 2,0:11:34.43,0:11:35.07,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah, cool stuff.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:35.25,0:11:36.33,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我已经有点纠结了
Dialogue: 2,0:11:35.25,0:11:36.33,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I'm already struggling.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:36.55,0:11:37.73,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}就像我脑子里在说
Dialogue: 2,0:11:36.55,0:11:37.73,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Like my brain's saying,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:37.83,0:11:38.77,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这个你给几分？
Dialogue: 2,0:11:37.83,0:11:38.77,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}how do you rate this?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:38.97,0:11:42.25,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}不过说真的 这绝对是我会再听的东西
Dialogue: 2,0:11:38.97,0:11:42.25,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}But yeah, it's definitely something I'll listen to again.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.39,0:11:44.39,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我儿子睡前会听音乐
Dialogue: 2,0:11:42.39,0:11:44.39,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}My son listens to music before bed.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:44.57,0:11:46.11,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我觉得我会……Alexa
Dialogue: 2,0:11:44.57,0:11:46.11,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I think I'll... Alexa,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:46.33,0:11:47.43,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}播放Minecraft原声带
Dialogue: 2,0:11:46.33,0:11:47.43,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}play Minecraft soundtrack.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:48.95,0:11:52.03,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}它确实有点摇篮曲那种感觉
Dialogue: 2,0:11:48.95,0:11:52.03,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}It does have like a lullaby sort of energy.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:52.23,0:11:53.09,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}不会把我吵醒
Dialogue: 2,0:11:52.23,0:11:53.09,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}It's not waking me up.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:53.13,0:11:53.67,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}那是肯定的
Dialogue: 2,0:11:53.13,0:11:53.67,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}That's for sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:53.89,0:11:54.15,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}是啊
Dialogue: 2,0:11:53.89,0:11:54.15,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:54.37,0:11:55.65,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}嗯 非常舒缓
Dialogue: 2,0:11:54.37,0:11:55.65,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah, very low energy.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:55.97,0:11:56.83,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}你直接让它放着就行
Dialogue: 2,0:11:55.97,0:11:56.83,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}You could just let it play.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:56.85,0:11:57.31,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我不知道
Dialogue: 2,0:11:56.85,0:11:57.31,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I don't know.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:57.45,0:11:58.39,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}好 那就让它放着吧
Dialogue: 2,0:11:57.45,0:11:58.39,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah, let's just let it play.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:58.39,0:12:00.09,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}就这样一直放着？
Dialogue: 2,0:11:58.39,0:12:00.09,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Just let it play throughout the whole thing?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:00.23,0:12:01.73,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}对 我们不需要停下来讨论
Dialogue: 2,0:12:00.23,0:12:01.73,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah, we don't need to just stop and talk about it.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:01.77,0:12:04.21,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}哦 那又是一首我们没啥好说的歌
Dialogue: 2,0:12:01.77,0:12:04.21,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Oh, that was another song that we don't have much to say about,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:04.37,0:12:04.77,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}但还挺酷的
Dialogue: 2,0:12:04.37,0:12:04.77,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}but it was cool.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:04.95,0:12:05.43,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}没错
Dialogue: 2,0:12:04.95,0:12:05.43,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}That's true.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:05.59,0:12:06.27,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我们可以边听边聊
Dialogue: 2,0:12:05.59,0:12:06.27,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}We can just talk throughout.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:06.65,0:12:07.01,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}试试吧
Dialogue: 2,0:12:06.65,0:12:07.01,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Let's try it.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:07.15,0:12:07.83,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}嗯 试试
Dialogue: 2,0:12:07.15,0:12:07.83,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah, let's try it.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:08.01,0:12:08.09,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}好
Dialogue: 2,0:12:08.01,0:12:08.09,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:08.17,0:12:08.83,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}换点不一样的
Dialogue: 2,0:12:08.17,0:12:08.83,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Something different.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:09.05,0:12:11.35,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我们停下来的时候其实一直在重复同样的话
Dialogue: 2,0:12:09.05,0:12:11.35,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}We're kind of saying the same thing over and over again when we stop.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:11.45,0:12:12.51,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}至少我感觉是这样
Dialogue: 2,0:12:11.45,0:12:12.51,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}At least I feel like I am,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:12.59,0:12:12.93,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}但是……
Dialogue: 2,0:12:12.59,0:12:12.93,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}but...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:12.93,0:12:13.19,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}对
Dialogue: 2,0:12:12.93,0:12:13.19,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:13.95,0:12:15.51,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}那我们就让它一直播下去吧
Dialogue: 2,0:12:13.95,0:12:15.51,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}So we're just gonna let it play through.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:15.77,0:12:17.11,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}如果你想让我们停下来
Dialogue: 2,0:12:15.77,0:12:17.11,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}And if you want us to stop,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:17.43,0:12:18.81,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}就叫我们
Dialogue: 2,0:12:17.43,0:12:18.81,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}just call us.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:19.05,0:12:19.93,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我们有热线电话
Dialogue: 2,0:12:19.05,0:12:19.93,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}We have a hotline.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:20.21,0:12:21.03,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}嗯哼 热线电话
Dialogue: 2,0:12:20.21,0:12:21.03,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Mm-hmm, hotline.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:21.15,0:12:22.95,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}那么这是从第11首开始的
Dialogue: 2,0:12:21.15,0:12:22.95,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}So this is track 11 onwards.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:23.45,0:12:24.63,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这首是 Mice On Venus
Dialogue: 2,0:12:23.45,0:12:24.63,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}This one's Mice On Venus.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:49.00,0:12:50.76,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}真的很喜欢我的这两首歌
Dialogue: 2,0:12:49.00,0:12:50.76,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I really dug both my songs.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:51.50,0:12:53.84,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}第一首我的歌在这首我的歌里
Dialogue: 2,0:12:51.50,0:12:53.84,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}The first my song in this my song.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:55.06,0:12:56.34,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这首真的很美
Dialogue: 2,0:12:55.06,0:12:56.34,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}This one's really pretty.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:58.60,0:13:00.18,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}不过有点苦乐参半
Dialogue: 2,0:12:58.60,0:13:00.18,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Kind of bittersweet, though.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:08.08,0:13:09.36,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}有趣的小知识
Dialogue: 2,0:13:08.08,0:13:09.36,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Interesting factoid.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:10.24,0:13:12.38,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}金星有失控的温室效应
Dialogue: 2,0:13:10.24,0:13:12.38,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Venus has a runaway greenhouse effect.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:12.52,0:13:14.84,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}所以任何在那里的老鼠都会瞬间被烧死
Dialogue: 2,0:13:12.52,0:13:14.84,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}So any mice on there would burn instantly.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:16.22,0:13:22.46,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}俄罗斯人向金星发射了一个探测器 它在几秒钟内就被压缩并过热了
Dialogue: 2,0:13:16.22,0:13:22.46,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}The Russians sent a probe to Venus and it compressed and superheated within seconds.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:22.56,0:13:25.68,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}但它确实拍到了一些照片并传了回来
Dialogue: 2,0:13:22.56,0:13:25.68,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}But it did get some pictures and send them back.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:26.88,0:13:28.66,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}关于金星表面
Dialogue: 2,0:13:26.88,0:13:28.66,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Of the surface of Venus.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:31.97,0:13:35.53,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}所以我们从那非常漂亮的钢琴开始 现在我们到了这里
Dialogue: 2,0:13:31.97,0:13:35.53,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}So we start at that one really pretty piano and now we're here.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:36.43,0:13:37.47,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}是的 我们到了
Dialogue: 2,0:13:36.43,0:13:37.47,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah, we're here.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:37.65,0:13:38.27,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这是什么？
Dialogue: 2,0:13:37.65,0:13:38.27,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}What is this?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:38.37,0:13:42.29,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这只是高能量的怪异
Dialogue: 2,0:13:38.37,0:13:42.29,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}This is just high-energy weirdness.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:44.19,0:13:46.95,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我只是想象有人小跑着
Dialogue: 2,0:13:44.19,0:13:46.95,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I just picture someone trotting along.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:51.16,0:13:52.02,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}那些弦乐
Dialogue: 2,0:13:51.16,0:13:52.02,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Those strings.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:53.06,0:13:54.76,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}但高音区的那个特雷门琴
Dialogue: 2,0:13:53.06,0:13:54.76,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}But that theremin in the top end.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.78,0:13:57.06,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}有点让人不舒服
Dialogue: 2,0:13:55.78,0:13:57.06,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}It's kind of off-putting.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:57.20,0:13:58.26,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我在想发生了什么
Dialogue: 2,0:13:57.20,0:13:58.26,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I'm wondering what's happening.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:01.24,0:14:05.12,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}就像那个在歌曲期间一直说话的烦人的人
Dialogue: 2,0:14:01.24,0:14:05.12,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}It's like that annoying person who keeps talking through songs.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:08.64,0:14:10.70,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这首叫Dry Hands
Dialogue: 2,0:14:08.64,0:14:10.70,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}This one's called Dry Hands.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:12.04,0:14:13.36,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}你已经猜到了吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:14:12.04,0:14:13.36,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Did you announce that already?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:15.22,0:14:15.84,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我猜是吧
Dialogue: 2,0:14:15.22,0:14:15.84,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I guess.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:15.92,0:14:18.32,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}是啊 我们是不是因为必须得猜到才宣布？
Dialogue: 2,0:14:15.92,0:14:18.32,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah, are we announcing them since we kind of have to?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:19.18,0:14:20.60,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我们那些悲伤的听众会想
Dialogue: 2,0:14:19.18,0:14:20.60,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Our sad listeners will be like,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:20.64,0:14:21.30,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这是什么？
Dialogue: 2,0:14:20.64,0:14:21.30,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}what is this?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:21.42,0:14:22.82,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这是不是老鼠在另一个星球上？
Dialogue: 2,0:14:21.42,0:14:22.82,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Is this mice on another planet?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:23.22,0:14:24.50,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}所以这首叫Dry Hands
Dialogue: 2,0:14:23.22,0:14:24.50,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}So this one's called Dry Hands.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:24.82,0:14:25.30,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}好的
Dialogue: 2,0:14:24.82,0:14:25.30,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:25.58,0:14:26.30,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这是第九首
Dialogue: 2,0:14:25.58,0:14:26.30,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}It's track 9.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:27.26,0:14:27.74,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}10
Dialogue: 2,0:14:27.26,0:14:27.74,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}10.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.02,0:14:28.38,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}12
Dialogue: 2,0:14:28.02,0:14:28.38,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}12.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.84,0:14:29.32,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}12！
Dialogue: 2,0:14:28.84,0:14:29.32,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}12!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:29.70,0:14:31.34,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}时间都去哪了？
Dialogue: 2,0:14:29.70,0:14:31.34,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Where have the time gone?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.42,0:14:39.34,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我确实喜欢整首的钢琴音色
Dialogue: 2,0:14:36.42,0:14:39.34,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I do love the piano tones throughout.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:40.50,0:14:40.76,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}是的
Dialogue: 2,0:14:40.50,0:14:40.76,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:46.11,0:14:48.05,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}你想猜一下这首的标题吗
Dialogue: 2,0:14:46.11,0:14:48.05,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Did you want to announce the title of this one,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.61,0:14:49.41,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这是Wet Hands
Dialogue: 2,0:14:48.61,0:14:49.41,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}It's Wet Hands.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:50.57,0:14:51.13,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}聪明
Dialogue: 2,0:14:50.57,0:14:51.13,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Clever.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:57.09,0:14:58.45,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}你更想要哪种？
Dialogue: 2,0:14:57.09,0:14:58.45,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}What would you rather have?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:59.11,0:15:00.93,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Wet Hands还是dry hands？
Dialogue: 2,0:14:59.11,0:15:00.93,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Wet hands or dry hands?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:03.39,0:15:03.95,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}dry
Dialogue: 2,0:15:03.39,0:15:03.95,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Dry.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:05.41,0:15:07.11,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}但不是那种消极的干
Dialogue: 2,0:15:05.41,0:15:07.11,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}But not like a negative dry,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:07.21,0:15:08.49,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}比如开裂
Dialogue: 2,0:15:07.21,0:15:08.49,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}like cracking.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.01,0:15:10.01,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}只是不要湿
Dialogue: 2,0:15:09.01,0:15:10.01,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Just not wet.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:10.83,0:15:11.97,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}是啊 你更想湿？
Dialogue: 2,0:15:10.83,0:15:11.97,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah, you would prefer wet?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:12.59,0:15:14.15,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}比起干燥裂开的手？
Dialogue: 2,0:15:12.59,0:15:14.15,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Over dry, cracking hands?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:14.27,0:15:14.55,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}是的
Dialogue: 2,0:15:14.27,0:15:14.55,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:17.66,0:15:20.82,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我开始涂保湿霜了 因为冬天太干了
Dialogue: 2,0:15:17.66,0:15:20.82,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I'm starting to moisturize because it's been such a dry winter.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:21.44,0:15:21.78,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}没错
Dialogue: 2,0:15:21.44,0:15:21.78,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}It's true.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:22.00,0:15:23.62,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}今天有极寒警报
Dialogue: 2,0:15:22.00,0:15:23.62,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}There's an extreme cold warning today.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:24.28,0:15:25.54,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}是啊 我在外面待了一会儿
Dialogue: 2,0:15:24.28,0:15:25.54,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah, I was outside for a while.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:25.72,0:15:26.56,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}糟透了
Dialogue: 2,0:15:25.72,0:15:26.56,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}It sucked.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:28.36,0:15:30.08,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}幸好我手没湿
Dialogue: 2,0:15:28.36,0:15:30.08,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Glad I didn't have wet hands.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:31.24,0:15:32.90,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这首歌叫Clark
Dialogue: 2,0:15:31.24,0:15:32.90,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}This song is called Clark.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:33.90,0:15:38.70,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这也是苏斯博士笔下角色的名字 他不能在天黑时出门
Dialogue: 2,0:15:33.90,0:15:38.70,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Which is also the name of a Dr. Seuss character who can't go out in the dark.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:39.86,0:15:41.36,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}而且对我来说
Dialogue: 2,0:15:39.86,0:15:41.36,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}And it was like, for me,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:41.42,0:15:43.20,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这是苏斯博士角色里最好玩的名字
Dialogue: 2,0:15:41.42,0:15:43.20,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}the funnest name of a Dr. Seuss character.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:43.42,0:15:43.76,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Clark
Dialogue: 2,0:15:43.42,0:15:43.76,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Clark.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:44.50,0:15:45.14,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这是Clark
Dialogue: 2,0:15:44.50,0:15:45.14,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}This is Clark.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:45.22,0:15:46.32,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}他不能在天黑时出门
Dialogue: 2,0:15:45.22,0:15:46.32,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}He can't go out in the dark.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:49.91,0:15:51.05,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}很多合成器音浪
Dialogue: 2,0:15:49.91,0:15:51.05,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}A lot of synth waves.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:55.23,0:15:59.25,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我觉得这是个弦乐垫
Dialogue: 2,0:15:55.23,0:15:59.25,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I think this is a string pad.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:01.19,0:16:06.61,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}他们有时会用这些合成弦乐音色做背景垫
Dialogue: 2,0:16:01.19,0:16:06.61,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}They have these pads sometimes that are like synth strings as a synth pad.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:09.86,0:16:10.48,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}总之
Dialogue: 2,0:16:09.86,0:16:10.48,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Anyways.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:10.84,0:16:11.76,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}要学的太多了
Dialogue: 2,0:16:10.84,0:16:11.76,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}So much to learn.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:16.70,0:16:19.56,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这感觉像是我们第一次遇到贝斯线
Dialogue: 2,0:16:16.70,0:16:19.56,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}This feels like the first bass line we've had.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:20.52,0:16:20.80,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}是的
Dialogue: 2,0:16:20.52,0:16:20.80,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:22.22,0:16:25.16,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}所以打击乐部分一直很少
Dialogue: 2,0:16:22.22,0:16:25.16,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}So it's been very sparse on the percussion.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:26.44,0:16:30.40,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}大概只有两首歌有某种形式的打击乐
Dialogue: 2,0:16:26.44,0:16:30.40,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Had like two songs with any form of that.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:31.16,0:16:32.66,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}你把钟琴也算进打击乐吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:16:31.16,0:16:32.66,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Are you including bells in percussion?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:32.66,0:16:35.28,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我想钢琴也算吧
Dialogue: 2,0:16:32.66,0:16:35.28,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I guess piano also counts.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:35.82,0:16:36.20,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我猜是的
Dialogue: 2,0:16:35.82,0:16:36.20,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I guess.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:36.98,0:16:37.88,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}对 你说得对
Dialogue: 2,0:16:36.98,0:16:37.88,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:41.10,0:16:43.80,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Clark是我儿子不错的睡前歌曲
Dialogue: 2,0:16:41.10,0:16:43.80,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Clark is a good bedtime song for my son.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.75,0:16:51.11,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这是Chris
Dialogue: 2,0:16:49.75,0:16:51.11,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}This is Chris.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:57.69,0:16:58.39,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}鼓刷
Dialogue: 2,0:16:57.69,0:16:58.39,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Brushes.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:59.29,0:16:59.73,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}是的
Dialogue: 2,0:16:59.29,0:16:59.73,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:00.65,0:17:01.93,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}正如我刚才所说的
Dialogue: 2,0:17:00.65,0:17:01.93,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Just as I was saying.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:10.06,0:17:11.41,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这是Thera长笛吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:17:10.06,0:17:11.41,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Is this the Thera Flute?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:13.86,0:17:14.67,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}差不多吧
Dialogue: 2,0:17:13.86,0:17:14.67,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Something like that.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:17.43,0:17:19.37,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Chris真的很投入
Dialogue: 2,0:17:17.43,0:17:19.37,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Chris is really going for it.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:20.87,0:17:22.09,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Clark有点无聊
Dialogue: 2,0:17:20.87,0:17:22.09,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Clark was a little boring.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:24.87,0:17:27.77,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Chris是《我的世界》里的夜生活
Dialogue: 2,0:17:24.87,0:17:27.77,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Chris is nightlife in Minecraft.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:29.69,0:17:31.47,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这首曲目叫做13
Dialogue: 2,0:17:29.69,0:17:31.47,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}This track is called 13.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:37.01,0:17:38.59,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}尽管它是第16曲
Dialogue: 2,0:17:37.01,0:17:38.59,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Even though it's track 16.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:40.83,0:17:41.79,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}C418真聪明
Dialogue: 2,0:17:40.83,0:17:41.79,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Clever C418.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:42.45,0:17:42.89,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}聪明
Dialogue: 2,0:17:42.45,0:17:42.89,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Clever.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:43.37,0:17:44.55,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}如果那是你的真名
Dialogue: 2,0:17:43.37,0:17:44.55,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}If that is your real name.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:46.07,0:17:50.49,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}所以 到目前为止 我觉得这很适合冥想 除了那段杀鸡的
Dialogue: 2,0:17:46.07,0:17:50.49,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}So, so far I'm thinking this would be a great meditation thing except for that one where they kill the chicken.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:50.49,0:17:50.97,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}死亡？
Dialogue: 2,0:17:50.49,0:17:50.97,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Death?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:51.41,0:17:52.23,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}是啊 是啊
Dialogue: 2,0:17:51.41,0:17:52.23,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:52.77,0:17:54.01,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}不过这首有点诡异
Dialogue: 2,0:17:52.77,0:17:54.01,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}This one was eerie though.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:54.11,0:17:55.25,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这一首感觉……
Dialogue: 2,0:17:54.11,0:17:55.25,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}This one felt...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:55.25,0:17:55.83,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}没关系
Dialogue: 2,0:17:55.25,0:17:55.83,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}That's okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:57.19,0:17:58.31,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}因为不能有像“咯咯”这样的声音！
Dialogue: 2,0:17:57.19,0:17:58.31,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Because you can't have like a B'gok!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:59.43,0:18:00.19,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}在中间
Dialogue: 2,0:17:59.43,0:18:00.19,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}In the middle.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:00.91,0:18:01.29,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}没错
Dialogue: 2,0:18:00.91,0:18:01.29,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}True.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:01.79,0:18:03.29,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这首曲目叫Excuse
Dialogue: 2,0:18:01.79,0:18:03.29,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}This track is called Excuse.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:06.33,0:18:07.09,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}对吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:18:06.33,0:18:07.09,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Is that right?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:08.43,0:18:09.55,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}还是说X-cuse？
Dialogue: 2,0:18:08.43,0:18:09.55,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Or is it X-cuse?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:10.95,0:18:11.81,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我想都有可能
Dialogue: 2,0:18:10.95,0:18:11.81,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I guess it could be either.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.63,0:18:13.17,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}或者两者皆可
Dialogue: 2,0:18:12.63,0:18:13.17,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Or either.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.44,0:18:23.00,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}你想说出这一首的名字吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:18:21.44,0:18:23.00,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Did you want to say the name of this one,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:23.06,0:18:23.36,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我的朋友？
Dialogue: 2,0:18:23.06,0:18:23.36,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}my friend?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:23.74,0:18:24.66,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}是的 这首是Sweden
Dialogue: 2,0:18:23.74,0:18:24.66,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah, this one's Sweden.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:25.32,0:18:26.96,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}所以我猜他一定是瑞典人
Dialogue: 2,0:18:25.32,0:18:26.96,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}So I guess he must be Swedish.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:27.22,0:18:28.76,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我们有Hagstrom 也有Sweden
Dialogue: 2,0:18:27.22,0:18:28.76,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}We had Hagstrom, we had Sweden.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:29.76,0:18:30.42,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我们有Chris
Dialogue: 2,0:18:29.76,0:18:30.42,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}We had Chris.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:32.02,0:18:33.62,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这是瑞典名字 对吧？
Dialogue: 2,0:18:32.02,0:18:33.62,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}It's a Swedish name, isn't it?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:34.30,0:18:34.46,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Chris！
Dialogue: 2,0:18:34.30,0:18:34.46,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Chris!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:38.42,0:18:40.32,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}是的 这首也相当经典
Dialogue: 2,0:18:38.42,0:18:40.32,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah, this one's a pretty iconic one too.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:52.46,0:18:52.98,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}天哪
Dialogue: 2,0:18:52.46,0:18:52.98,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Man.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:54.64,0:18:55.46,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}一些音效
Dialogue: 2,0:18:54.64,0:18:55.46,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Some hits.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:55.88,0:18:56.64,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}钢琴音效
Dialogue: 2,0:18:55.88,0:18:56.64,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Piano hits.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:57.76,0:18:59.12,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}是的 这不是排行榜上的
Dialogue: 2,0:18:57.76,0:18:59.12,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah, this is not charting.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:00.96,0:19:03.10,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我想知道这首是否曾经上过榜单
Dialogue: 2,0:19:00.96,0:19:03.10,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I wonder if this hit the charts at one point.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:03.22,0:19:03.46,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}也许吧
Dialogue: 2,0:19:03.22,0:19:03.46,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Maybe.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:05.22,0:19:07.16,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这张专辑肯定有混音版
Dialogue: 2,0:19:05.22,0:19:07.16,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}There's got to be like a remix of this album.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:07.96,0:19:09.70,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}你知道 可能有个house混音或者什么的
Dialogue: 2,0:19:07.96,0:19:09.70,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}You know, there's probably like a house remix or something.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.58,0:19:14.24,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}是的 有几次我都想在里面加些东西
Dialogue: 2,0:19:10.58,0:19:14.24,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah, there's a couple of times where I wanted to drop some stuff in there.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:19.85,0:19:22.35,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这与我们通常做的音乐太不一样了
Dialogue: 2,0:19:19.85,0:19:22.35,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}It's such a departure from the music we normally do.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:25.95,0:19:27.63,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我知道 这非常不同
Dialogue: 2,0:19:25.95,0:19:27.63,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I know, this is very different.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:28.57,0:19:29.23,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}非常不同
Dialogue: 2,0:19:28.57,0:19:29.23,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Very different.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:32.67,0:19:34.89,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}可能这是我们迄今为止最放松的一集
Dialogue: 2,0:19:32.67,0:19:34.89,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Probably our most relaxed episode yet.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:38.16,0:19:40.18,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这首歌完全给人一种猫的感觉
Dialogue: 2,0:19:38.16,0:19:40.18,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}This song is totally giving cat vibes.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:40.76,0:19:42.38,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}总是忙着蹦来蹦去
Dialogue: 2,0:19:40.76,0:19:42.38,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Always busy bouncing around.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:47.94,0:19:50.30,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}是的 这可以在猫的头上播放
Dialogue: 2,0:19:47.94,0:19:50.30,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah, this could be playing on a cat's head.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:50.86,0:19:51.06,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}是的
Dialogue: 2,0:19:50.86,0:19:51.06,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:51.66,0:19:53.92,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我觉得这是猫核
Dialogue: 2,0:19:51.66,0:19:53.92,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I feel like this is catcore.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:56.30,0:19:57.96,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这很有电子游戏的感觉
Dialogue: 2,0:19:56.30,0:19:57.96,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}This is very video game-y.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:01.90,0:20:04.80,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这些音符几乎就像...
Dialogue: 2,0:20:01.90,0:20:04.80,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}The notes are almost like...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:05.64,0:20:06.18,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}比特
Dialogue: 2,0:20:05.64,0:20:06.18,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}bits.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:06.78,0:20:07.48,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}是的 像8-bit
Dialogue: 2,0:20:06.78,0:20:07.48,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah, like 8-bit.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:08.86,0:20:11.62,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}非常嗡嗡作响 那种街机风格
Dialogue: 2,0:20:08.86,0:20:11.62,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Very buzzy and that sort of arcade-y thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:11.76,0:20:12.04,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}是的
Dialogue: 2,0:20:11.76,0:20:12.04,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:17.30,0:20:18.56,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我也记得 比如
Dialogue: 2,0:20:17.30,0:20:18.56,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I remember too, like,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:19.06,0:20:22.70,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}玩最初的电子游戏时 完全沉浸其中
Dialogue: 2,0:20:19.06,0:20:22.70,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}playing the first video games and being so locked into the game.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:23.06,0:20:24.02,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}就像真的一样
Dialogue: 2,0:20:23.06,0:20:24.02,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}It was like real.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:24.58,0:20:25.82,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}然后当你环顾四周时
Dialogue: 2,0:20:24.58,0:20:25.82,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}And then when you looked around,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:25.84,0:20:26.26,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}你就会想 哦对
Dialogue: 2,0:20:25.84,0:20:26.26,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}you're like, oh yeah,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:26.32,0:20:26.54,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}对
Dialogue: 2,0:20:26.32,0:20:26.54,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}right.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:26.66,0:20:27.00,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}好吧
Dialogue: 2,0:20:26.66,0:20:27.00,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}All right.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:27.58,0:20:28.98,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}不过我确实很喜欢这些合成器
Dialogue: 2,0:20:27.58,0:20:28.98,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I do love these synths though.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:29.94,0:20:34.82,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我刚想说 我和女朋友最喜欢的消遣之一就是玩……
Dialogue: 2,0:20:29.94,0:20:34.82,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I was going to say, one of my girlfriend and I's favorite pastime is playing...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:36.34,0:20:37.40,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}使命召唤：僵尸
Dialogue: 2,0:20:36.34,0:20:37.40,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Call of Duty Zombies.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:37.50,0:20:38.30,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我们经常玩那个
Dialogue: 2,0:20:37.50,0:20:38.30,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}We do that a lot.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:38.84,0:20:39.02,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}什么？
Dialogue: 2,0:20:38.84,0:20:39.02,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}What?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:39.26,0:20:40.26,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}在Xbox上？
Dialogue: 2,0:20:39.26,0:20:40.26,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}On Xbox?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:40.68,0:20:40.94,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}对
Dialogue: 2,0:20:40.68,0:20:40.94,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:42.62,0:20:44.62,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我和我儿子玩《老虎伍兹高尔夫》
Dialogue: 2,0:20:42.62,0:20:44.62,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I do Tiger Woods Golf with my son.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:46.76,0:20:47.88,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}PS1赛车
Dialogue: 2,0:20:46.76,0:20:47.88,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}PS1 Racing.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:49.72,0:20:52.98,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这首歌叫Dog 是第18首曲目
Dialogue: 2,0:20:49.72,0:20:52.98,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}This song's called Dog and it's track number 18,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:53.16,0:20:53.52,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}大概吧
Dialogue: 2,0:20:53.16,0:20:53.52,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I guess?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:53.84,0:20:54.18,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}19.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:53.84,0:20:54.18,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}19.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:54.46,0:20:54.58,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}19.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:54.46,0:20:54.58,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}19.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:54.58,0:20:54.96,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}不 是20
Dialogue: 2,0:20:54.58,0:20:54.96,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}No, 20.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:56.16,0:20:56.72,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}20？！
Dialogue: 2,0:20:56.16,0:20:56.72,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}20?!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:56.72,0:20:57.80,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}是的 我们快结束了
Dialogue: 2,0:20:56.72,0:20:57.80,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah, we're nearing the end.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:59.86,0:21:01.34,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这根本不像Dog
Dialogue: 2,0:20:59.86,0:21:01.34,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}This is so not Dog.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:01.50,0:21:02.36,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我的狗就像……
Dialogue: 2,0:21:01.50,0:21:02.36,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}My dogs are like...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:06.17,0:21:07.75,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我的狗不是那种沉稳的
Dialogue: 2,0:21:06.17,0:21:07.75,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}My dogs are not composed.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:09.43,0:21:12.47,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}疯狂的小毛球 充满愤怒
Dialogue: 2,0:21:09.43,0:21:12.47,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Crazy little fluff balls of fury.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:14.61,0:21:16.91,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我相当肯定在游戏早期版本里
Dialogue: 2,0:21:14.61,0:21:16.91,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I'm pretty sure in the early versions of the game,
Dialogue: 1,0:21:17.13,0:21:19.15,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}你能拥有的宠物只有猫和狗
Dialogue: 2,0:21:17.13,0:21:19.15,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}the only two pets you could have are cat and dog.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:19.25,0:21:20.65,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}所以这可能是它们的音乐
Dialogue: 2,0:21:19.25,0:21:20.65,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}So maybe this is cued by them.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:20.75,0:21:21.19,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我不知道
Dialogue: 2,0:21:20.75,0:21:21.19,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I don't know.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.26,0:21:23.30,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}你驯服……
Dialogue: 2,0:21:22.26,0:21:23.30,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}You tame...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:24.39,0:21:26.31,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}但当你杀死游戏里的骷髅时
Dialogue: 2,0:21:24.39,0:21:26.31,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}But when you kill a skeleton in the game,
Dialogue: 1,0:21:26.85,0:21:28.25,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}当它们是夜间生物之一时
Dialogue: 2,0:21:26.85,0:21:28.25,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}when it's one of the mobs at night,
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.41,0:21:29.05,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}你会得到骨头
Dialogue: 2,0:21:28.41,0:21:29.05,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}you get bones.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:29.67,0:21:31.65,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}所以你就是那样把狼驯养成宠物的
Dialogue: 2,0:21:29.67,0:21:31.65,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}So that's how you tame the wolves into being your pet.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:32.51,0:21:35.31,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}然后对于猫 我觉得你得抓鱼
Dialogue: 2,0:21:32.51,0:21:35.31,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}And then for cats, I think you have to get fish.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:37.27,0:21:40.91,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}人类就是这样让最早的狼变成狗的
Dialogue: 2,0:21:37.27,0:21:40.91,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}That's how humans got the first wolves to be dogs.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:42.27,0:21:47.39,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}他们会有那些垃圾堆 人类把废弃物倒在那里 然后狼就待在那里
Dialogue: 2,0:21:42.27,0:21:47.39,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}They'd have these trash piles where humans would dump the refuse and then the wolves would hang out there.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:47.89,0:21:53.79,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}然后你们越来越接近彼此 互相习惯 最终它们开始成为宠物
Dialogue: 2,0:21:47.89,0:21:53.79,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Then you'd get closer and closer to each other and get used to each other and eventually they started being pets.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:54.49,0:21:55.05,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}真疯狂
Dialogue: 2,0:21:54.49,0:21:55.05,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}That's crazy.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:55.37,0:21:56.83,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}当其他动物来的时候
Dialogue: 2,0:21:55.37,0:21:56.83,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}When other animals would come,
Dialogue: 1,0:21:57.05,0:22:01.03,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}狼会叫 所以人类看到了拥有的价值……
Dialogue: 2,0:21:57.05,0:22:01.03,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}the wolves would bark so the humans saw value in having...
Dialogue: 1,0:22:01.03,0:22:01.79,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}像是警报
Dialogue: 2,0:22:01.03,0:22:01.79,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Like an alert.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:01.93,0:22:02.23,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}是啊
Dialogue: 2,0:22:01.93,0:22:02.23,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:02.97,0:22:04.35,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}但它们也帮助打猎
Dialogue: 2,0:22:02.97,0:22:04.35,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}But they help with the hunt.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.51,0:22:06.67,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}摸它们很好玩
Dialogue: 2,0:22:05.51,0:22:06.67,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}They're fun to pet.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:08.57,0:22:11.37,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}你不觉得这抓住了狗的顽皮天性吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:22:08.57,0:22:11.37,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Do you not think this captures the playful nature of a dog though?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.59,0:22:11.79,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}是的
Dialogue: 2,0:22:11.59,0:22:11.79,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.27,0:22:16.05,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我真的很喜欢……不过我喜欢这两个
Dialogue: 2,0:22:14.27,0:22:16.05,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I really like... I like these two though.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.17,0:22:17.01,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我喜欢猫和狗
Dialogue: 2,0:22:16.17,0:22:17.01,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I like cat and dog.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.73,0:22:18.33,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}它们很有趣
Dialogue: 2,0:22:17.73,0:22:18.33,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}They're fun.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:18.37,0:22:19.07,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这些曲子很好听
Dialogue: 2,0:22:18.37,0:22:19.07,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}They're fun tunes.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.43,0:22:20.33,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}哦 是啊 我同意
Dialogue: 2,0:22:19.43,0:22:20.33,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Oh, yeah, I agree.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.15,0:22:24.13,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这个……不过我不知道它适不适合冥想
Dialogue: 2,0:22:22.15,0:22:24.13,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}This... I don't know if it would work for meditation though.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.65,0:22:27.37,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}是的 适合
Dialogue: 2,0:22:26.65,0:22:27.37,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yep, it would.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:29.49,0:22:33.39,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我确实喜欢它的一点是整首曲子都很有旋律感
Dialogue: 2,0:22:29.49,0:22:33.39,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}What I do like about it throughout the whole thing is that it's like melodic.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.57,0:22:35.45,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}就像总是有一条旋律可以跟着
Dialogue: 2,0:22:33.57,0:22:35.45,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Like there's like always like a melody to follow.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.45,0:22:39.65,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}而且他常常在整首曲子中重复这个旋律
Dialogue: 2,0:22:35.45,0:22:39.65,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}And one that he'll often repeat throughout the tune,
Dialogue: 1,0:22:39.77,0:22:40.35,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这很好
Dialogue: 2,0:22:39.77,0:22:40.35,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}which is nice.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.85,0:22:42.77,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}所以它不只是……只是和弦
Dialogue: 2,0:22:40.85,0:22:42.77,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}So it's not just like... just like chords.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:42.93,0:22:43.51,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}它就像 你知道的
Dialogue: 2,0:22:42.93,0:22:43.51,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}It's just like, you know,
Dialogue: 1,0:22:43.53,0:22:45.55,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}有个东西可以抓一抓
Dialogue: 2,0:22:43.53,0:22:45.55,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}there's something to grab onto a little bit.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:46.05,0:22:46.49,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}同意
Dialogue: 2,0:22:46.05,0:22:46.49,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Agreed.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:46.57,0:22:50.33,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}然后你会在旋律上下听到这些美妙的加花 令人兴奋
Dialogue: 2,0:22:46.57,0:22:50.33,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}And then you get these nice fills above and below the melody that are exciting.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.55,0:22:51.65,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这首叫Danny
Dialogue: 2,0:22:50.55,0:22:51.65,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}This one's called Danny.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.15,0:22:52.75,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}很多名字
Dialogue: 2,0:22:52.15,0:22:52.75,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}A lot of names.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.49,0:23:16.69,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}是的 这些歌让我回到了从前
Dialogue: 2,0:23:15.49,0:23:16.69,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah, these songs take me back.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:18.79,0:23:23.31,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我小的时候 我父母在家里的电脑上设置了家长控制
Dialogue: 2,0:23:18.79,0:23:23.31,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}When I was younger, my parents had parental controls on the family computer.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:23.51,0:23:23.95,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}哦 太好了
Dialogue: 2,0:23:23.51,0:23:23.95,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Oh, good.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:24.23,0:23:24.45,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}是啊
Dialogue: 2,0:23:24.23,0:23:24.45,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:24.45,0:23:27.07,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}所以我们每天只允许大概30分钟
Dialogue: 2,0:23:24.45,0:23:27.07,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}So we only allowed like 30 minutes per day.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:27.57,0:23:32.47,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}而且我经常和朋友打电话玩《我的世界》
Dialogue: 2,0:23:27.57,0:23:32.47,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}And I would play Minecraft with my friends over the phone all the time.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:32.57,0:23:35.99,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}比如在Mineplex上玩《饥饿游戏》
Dialogue: 2,0:23:32.57,0:23:35.99,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Like playing Hunger Games on Mineplex.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:36.35,0:23:38.65,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}那是一个服务器 你只要……就像《饥饿游戏》
Dialogue: 2,0:23:36.35,0:23:38.65,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}It's like a server where you just... it's like Hunger Games,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:38.81,0:23:39.43,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}但是在《我的世界》里
Dialogue: 2,0:23:38.81,0:23:39.43,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}but in Minecraft.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:39.77,0:23:40.11,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}哦 酷
Dialogue: 2,0:23:39.77,0:23:40.11,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Oh, cool.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:40.41,0:23:40.97,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}太好玩了
Dialogue: 2,0:23:40.41,0:23:40.97,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}It's so fun.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:41.81,0:23:42.63,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这就是我喜欢《我的世界》的地方
Dialogue: 2,0:23:41.81,0:23:42.63,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}That's what I like about Minecraft.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:42.71,0:23:43.69,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}你总能和别人一起玩
Dialogue: 2,0:23:42.71,0:23:43.69,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}You can always play with people.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:44.95,0:23:46.05,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这是第23首？
Dialogue: 2,0:23:44.95,0:23:46.05,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}This is track 23?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:46.63,0:23:47.11,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}第22首
Dialogue: 2,0:23:46.63,0:23:47.11,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}22.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:48.07,0:23:49.47,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我永远都猜不对
Dialogue: 2,0:23:48.07,0:23:49.47,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I'm never gonna guess right.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:49.81,0:23:51.53,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}第22首Beginning
Dialogue: 2,0:23:49.81,0:23:51.53,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Track 22, Beginning.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:58.33,0:24:00.15,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我觉得《我的世界》
Dialogue: 2,0:23:58.33,0:24:00.15,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I think also Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:24:00.63,0:24:06.01,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fs75}在新冠疫情期间 他们联系教育工作者 让我们在课堂上使用《我的世界》
Dialogue: 2,0:24:00.63,0:24:06.01,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}they tapped educators at this time during COVID to get us to use Minecraft in classes
Dialogue: 1,0:24:06.01,0:24:08.51,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}因为孩子们反正都在家对着电脑
Dialogue: 2,0:24:06.01,0:24:08.51,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}because kids were at home on theircomputers anyway.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:08.77,0:24:09.91,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}他们想推广它
Dialogue: 2,0:24:08.77,0:24:09.91,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}They were trying to grow it.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:10.55,0:24:14.19,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}所以后来我确实给想做的孩子们布置了《我的世界》作业
Dialogue: 2,0:24:10.55,0:24:14.19,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}So then I did assign Minecraft assignments to kids who wanted them.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:14.89,0:24:16.17,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}而且我得到了一些很棒的作品
Dialogue: 2,0:24:14.89,0:24:16.17,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}And I got some really good stuff.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:17.11,0:24:18.35,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}他们建造了世界
Dialogue: 2,0:24:17.11,0:24:18.35,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}They built worlds.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:19.05,0:24:19.29,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}是的
Dialogue: 2,0:24:19.05,0:24:19.29,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:19.67,0:24:21.89,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}然后发给我 再一起讨论
Dialogue: 2,0:24:19.67,0:24:21.89,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Then sent them to me and then talked about them.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:22.09,0:24:22.51,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}那很酷
Dialogue: 2,0:24:22.09,0:24:22.51,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}That's cool.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:23.39,0:24:26.75,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这首叫Droopy Likes Ricochet
Dialogue: 2,0:24:23.39,0:24:26.75,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}This one's Droopy Likes Ricochet.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:29.39,0:24:31.13,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}谁不喜欢好的弹跳声呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:24:29.39,0:24:31.13,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Who doesn't like a good ricochet?
Dialogue: 1,0:24:32.65,0:24:32.99,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}对吧？
Dialogue: 2,0:24:32.65,0:24:32.99,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Right?
Dialogue: 1,0:24:38.40,0:24:38.92,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}打击乐
Dialogue: 2,0:24:38.40,0:24:38.92,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Percussion.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:39.40,0:24:41.52,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}是的 我记得我一直很喜欢最后两首
Dialogue: 2,0:24:39.40,0:24:41.52,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah, I always remember liking the last two a lot.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:46.01,0:24:47.79,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}打击乐是核心
Dialogue: 2,0:24:46.01,0:24:47.79,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Percussion is the forefront.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:05.93,0:25:07.65,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这让我想起治疗乐队的Pictures of You
Dialogue: 2,0:25:05.93,0:25:07.65,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}This reminds me of the Cure Pictures of You,
Dialogue: 1,0:25:08.01,0:25:11.15,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这也提醒我我们还没做过治疗乐队的专辑
Dialogue: 2,0:25:08.01,0:25:11.15,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}which also reminds me we haven't done a Cure album yet either.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:11.45,0:25:11.51,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我知道
Dialogue: 2,0:25:11.45,0:25:11.51,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I know.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:12.21,0:25:13.89,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我知道有……确实是这样
Dialogue: 2,0:25:12.21,0:25:13.89,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I know there's... it's true.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:14.23,0:25:16.11,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我们还需要做太多专辑了
Dialogue: 2,0:25:14.23,0:25:16.11,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}So many albums we need to do.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:19.62,0:25:21.28,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Droopy Likes Your Face
Dialogue: 2,0:25:19.62,0:25:21.28,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Droopy Likes Your Face.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:22.04,0:25:23.24,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}第24首
Dialogue: 2,0:25:22.04,0:25:23.24,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Track 24.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:25.04,0:25:26.44,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}总算说对了一次
Dialogue: 2,0:25:25.04,0:25:26.44,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Got it right for once.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:30.33,0:25:32.63,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}所以在Ricochet之后是Droopy Likes Your Face
Dialogue: 2,0:25:30.33,0:25:32.63,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}So post-Ricochet, Droopy Likes Your Face.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:37.69,0:25:39.89,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这是第一次出现人声吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:25:37.69,0:25:39.89,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Is this the first voice?
Dialogue: 1,0:25:41.63,0:25:43.29,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}是的 如果不算那只鸡的话
Dialogue: 2,0:25:41.63,0:25:43.29,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah, if you don't include the chicken.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:45.65,0:25:46.99,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我觉得也可以算
Dialogue: 2,0:25:45.65,0:25:46.99,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I guess you could.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:50.36,0:25:54.06,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}只认为人声才算声音 这很人类中心主义
Dialogue: 2,0:25:50.36,0:25:54.06,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Very anthro-centric to think only human voices.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:54.08,0:25:54.64,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}算上吧
Dialogue: 2,0:25:54.08,0:25:54.64,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Count.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:03.29,0:26:05.07,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这可以说是有点吓人
Dialogue: 2,0:26:03.29,0:26:05.07,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}This could be considered terrifying.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:06.53,0:26:07.83,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}就像某种恶魔般的低语
Dialogue: 2,0:26:06.53,0:26:07.83,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}It's like some like demonic whispers.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:08.39,0:26:08.69,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}是的
Dialogue: 2,0:26:08.39,0:26:08.69,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:08.85,0:26:11.25,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}不过配上很悦耳的器乐
Dialogue: 2,0:26:08.85,0:26:11.25,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Over really pleasant instrumental though.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:11.71,0:26:12.83,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}恶魔版的史蒂芬·霍金
Dialogue: 2,0:26:11.71,0:26:12.83,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Demonic Stephen Hawking.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:13.03,0:26:14.35,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}有点史蒂芬·霍金内核的感觉
Dialogue: 2,0:26:13.03,0:26:14.35,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}It's kind of Stephen Hawking core.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:14.73,0:26:18.61,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}所以这就是我们Minecraft volume alpha体验
Dialogue: 2,0:26:14.73,0:26:18.61,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}So that's our Minecraft volume alpha experience.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:18.97,0:26:20.29,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}真是一段难忘的体验
Dialogue: 2,0:26:18.97,0:26:20.29,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}What an experience it was.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:20.53,0:26:22.87,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我很抱歉自己说了太多话
Dialogue: 2,0:26:20.53,0:26:22.87,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I feel bad about how much I talked through it,
Dialogue: 1,0:26:23.03,0:26:23.95,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}但还是很棒的
Dialogue: 2,0:26:23.03,0:26:23.95,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}but it was good though.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:24.17,0:26:25.11,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我喜欢
Dialogue: 2,0:26:24.17,0:26:25.11,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I liked it.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:25.19,0:26:27.49,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我会再听一遍 当作冥想
Dialogue: 2,0:26:25.19,0:26:27.49,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Like I'm gonna listen to this again as meditation.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:27.85,0:26:28.95,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这是很适合播放的好音乐
Dialogue: 2,0:26:27.85,0:26:28.95,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}It's good music to have on.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:28.95,0:26:29.93,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我坚持这个看法
Dialogue: 2,0:26:28.95,0:26:29.93,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Like I stand by it.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:30.03,0:26:31.87,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}如果你在做事的时候放这个很不错
Dialogue: 2,0:26:30.03,0:26:31.87,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}It's like nice to put on if you're doing something.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:32.13,0:26:33.95,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}显然 我从游戏里就熟悉它了
Dialogue: 2,0:26:32.13,0:26:33.95,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Obviously, I'm familiar with it from the game,
Dialogue: 1,0:26:34.03,0:26:37.15,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}但是作为背景音乐 这真的是非常可爱的氛围音乐
Dialogue: 2,0:26:34.03,0:26:37.15,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}but it's just really lovely ambient music to have on.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:37.43,0:26:39.57,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}确实是可爱的氛围音乐
Dialogue: 2,0:26:37.43,0:26:39.57,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}It is lovely ambient music to have on.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:39.67,0:26:40.81,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我们来打个分吧
Dialogue: 2,0:26:39.67,0:26:40.81,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Let's get to rating here.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:40.95,0:26:44.55,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}比如说 和我们听过的其他东西相比 你会怎么评价这个？
Dialogue: 2,0:26:40.95,0:26:44.55,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Like, how do you rate something like this vis-a-vis everything else we've listened to?
Dialogue: 1,0:26:44.73,0:26:45.21,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我不知道
Dialogue: 2,0:26:44.73,0:26:45.21,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I don't know.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:45.27,0:26:46.41,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我不知道该怎么评价这个
Dialogue: 2,0:26:45.27,0:26:46.41,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I don't know how to rate this.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:46.63,0:26:50.49,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}对我们节目来说 这完全是另一个领域
Dialogue: 2,0:26:46.63,0:26:50.49,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}It's a different field completely for our show.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:50.89,0:26:51.53,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}所以怎么说？
Dialogue: 2,0:26:50.89,0:26:51.53,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}So like what?
Dialogue: 1,0:26:51.81,0:26:52.17,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我给B？
Dialogue: 2,0:26:51.81,0:26:52.17,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Do I say B?
Dialogue: 1,0:26:52.27,0:26:52.95,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我给A？
Dialogue: 2,0:26:52.27,0:26:52.95,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Do I say A?
Dialogue: 1,0:26:53.07,0:26:54.01,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我给……
Dialogue: 2,0:26:53.07,0:26:54.01,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Do I say...
Dialogue: 1,0:26:54.01,0:26:56.71,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}它不是S级 但对某些人来说可能是S级
Dialogue: 2,0:26:54.01,0:26:56.71,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}It's not S, but it could be S to someone.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:57.01,0:26:58.69,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}John Tesh大概会很喜欢
Dialogue: 2,0:26:57.01,0:26:58.69,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}John Tesh would probably really like it.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:59.11,0:27:00.01,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我不知道 兄弟
Dialogue: 2,0:26:59.11,0:27:00.01,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I don't know, dude.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:00.07,0:27:01.95,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}你心里怎么想就怎么来
Dialogue: 2,0:27:00.07,0:27:01.95,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Do whatever your heart is feeling.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:02.47,0:27:03.91,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我心里什么感觉都没有
Dialogue: 2,0:27:02.47,0:27:03.91,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}My heart doesn't feel anything.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:04.45,0:27:05.49,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}你会打多少分？
Dialogue: 2,0:27:04.45,0:27:05.49,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}What would you rate it?
Dialogue: 1,0:27:05.81,0:27:06.65,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我跟你一样
Dialogue: 2,0:27:05.81,0:27:06.65,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I'll copy you.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:06.93,0:27:07.69,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}你要抄我的？
Dialogue: 2,0:27:06.93,0:27:07.69,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}You're gonna copy me?
Dialogue: 1,0:27:07.83,0:27:08.03,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}不
Dialogue: 2,0:27:07.83,0:27:08.03,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}No.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:08.21,0:27:08.43,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}不
Dialogue: 2,0:27:08.21,0:27:08.43,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}No.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:08.51,0:27:08.99,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}好吧 行
Dialogue: 2,0:27:08.51,0:27:08.99,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:09.35,0:27:09.85,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我的意思是……
Dialogue: 2,0:27:09.35,0:27:09.85,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I mean...
Dialogue: 1,0:27:11.75,0:27:12.53,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我不知道
Dialogue: 2,0:27:11.75,0:27:12.53,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I don't know.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:12.87,0:27:13.05,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}B？
Dialogue: 2,0:27:12.87,0:27:13.05,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}B?
Dialogue: 1,0:27:14.01,0:27:14.81,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}那不就得了
Dialogue: 2,0:27:14.01,0:27:14.81,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}There you go.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:15.39,0:27:16.91,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我想我要给S+
Dialogue: 2,0:27:15.39,0:27:16.91,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I think I'm gonna go S+.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:17.41,0:27:18.47,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}很难打分 但是呢
Dialogue: 2,0:27:17.41,0:27:18.47,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}It's hard to rate, but like,
Dialogue: 1,0:27:18.59,0:27:20.67,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我真的说不出任何负面评价
Dialogue: 2,0:27:18.59,0:27:20.67,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}there's nothing negative I could say about it,
Dialogue: 1,0:27:20.71,0:27:22.23,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}真的 因为这是原声带
Dialogue: 2,0:27:20.71,0:27:22.23,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}really, because it's a soundtrack.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:22.55,0:27:24.17,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}嗯 我确实 我爱它
Dialogue: 2,0:27:22.55,0:27:24.17,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Like, and I do, I love it.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:24.23,0:27:25.09,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}嗯 它真的 就像
Dialogue: 2,0:27:24.23,0:27:25.09,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Like, it's really, like,
Dialogue: 1,0:27:25.13,0:27:28.05,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这是我在工作时经常听的东西之一
Dialogue: 2,0:27:25.13,0:27:28.05,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}it's one of my things that I listen to a lot when I'm doing work.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:28.05,0:27:29.95,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}但它不需要专心听
Dialogue: 2,0:27:28.05,0:27:29.95,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}But it requires no audio.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:30.07,0:27:30.99,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}放在背景里很不错
Dialogue: 2,0:27:30.07,0:27:30.99,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}It's nice to have in the background.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:31.17,0:27:32.21,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}音效设计很棒
Dialogue: 2,0:27:31.17,0:27:32.21,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}The sound design is awesome.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:32.45,0:27:33.15,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}非常精妙
Dialogue: 2,0:27:32.45,0:27:33.15,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}It's very intricate.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:33.45,0:27:35.09,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我喜欢它自始至终对旋律的专注
Dialogue: 2,0:27:33.45,0:27:35.09,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I love the focus on melody throughout.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:35.25,0:27:37.89,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}就是他带进带出的那些非常优美的旋律线
Dialogue: 2,0:27:35.25,0:27:37.89,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Just very pretty little lines that he brings in and out.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:38.13,0:27:38.79,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}无可挑剔
Dialogue: 2,0:27:38.13,0:27:38.79,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}No complaints.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:38.91,0:27:39.75,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这很难评论
Dialogue: 2,0:27:38.91,0:27:39.75,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}It's hard to comment on,
Dialogue: 1,0:27:39.75,0:27:40.87,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}比如 当有氛围音乐时
Dialogue: 2,0:27:39.75,0:27:40.87,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}like, ambient music when there's,
Dialogue: 1,0:27:41.03,0:27:42.57,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}你知道 更关注的是氛围和
Dialogue: 2,0:27:41.03,0:27:42.57,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}you know, the more focus is the atmosphere and,
Dialogue: 1,0:27:42.71,0:27:43.13,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}就像 那种感觉
Dialogue: 2,0:27:42.71,0:27:43.13,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}like, the feeling.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:43.33,0:27:45.11,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}而且我觉得它让人安心 只是因为
Dialogue: 2,0:27:43.33,0:27:45.11,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}And I find it comforting just because,
Dialogue: 1,0:27:45.41,0:27:46.83,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我想 我是玩着这款游戏长大的
Dialogue: 2,0:27:45.41,0:27:46.83,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I guess, I grew up playing the game.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:47.25,0:27:48.81,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}所以 这就是我对它的看法
Dialogue: 2,0:27:47.25,0:27:48.81,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}So that's, like, my approach to it.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:48.89,0:27:51.31,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}但我确实认为它很适合那种
Dialogue: 2,0:27:48.89,0:27:51.31,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}But I do think it lends itself to that kind of,
Dialogue: 1,0:27:51.55,0:27:52.61,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我不想说怀旧
Dialogue: 2,0:27:51.55,0:27:52.61,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I don't want to say nostalgia,
Dialogue: 1,0:27:52.73,0:27:53.45,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}因为对我来说 那就是怀旧
Dialogue: 2,0:27:52.73,0:27:53.45,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}because it's nostalgia for me,
Dialogue: 1,0:27:53.47,0:27:54.79,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}但这就有点像 苦乐参半
Dialogue: 2,0:27:53.47,0:27:54.79,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}but it's, like, kind of bittersweet,
Dialogue: 1,0:27:54.95,0:27:56.73,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}略带忧郁的声音
Dialogue: 2,0:27:54.95,0:27:56.73,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}slightly melancholic sound.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:56.73,0:27:58.31,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我确实很喜欢所有的钢琴部分
Dialogue: 2,0:27:56.73,0:27:58.31,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I do love all the piano parts,
Dialogue: 1,0:27:58.49,0:28:00.69,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}但我喜欢它 因为我也喜欢做氛围音乐
Dialogue: 2,0:27:58.49,0:28:00.69,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}but I love it because I like making ambient music too.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:00.81,0:28:01.91,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}所以我想这一首也是
Dialogue: 2,0:28:00.81,0:28:01.91,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}So I guess this one also,
Dialogue: 1,0:28:02.13,0:28:03.49,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}比如 有很多可以从中学习的东西
Dialogue: 2,0:28:02.13,0:28:03.49,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}like, lots to be learned from it.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:03.73,0:28:05.49,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}好的 对我来说就是这样
Dialogue: 2,0:28:03.73,0:28:05.49,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Okay, for me in that way.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:05.67,0:28:06.33,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}这是不同的东西
Dialogue: 2,0:28:05.67,0:28:06.33,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}It's something different.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:06.45,0:28:07.37,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我们在尝试一些不同的东西
Dialogue: 2,0:28:06.45,0:28:07.37,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}We were trying something different.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:07.57,0:28:08.63,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}那是不同的一集
Dialogue: 2,0:28:07.57,0:28:08.63,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}It was a different episode,
Dialogue: 1,0:28:08.63,0:28:12.53,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}但是非常感谢你加入我们的Minecraft
Dialogue: 2,0:28:08.63,0:28:12.53,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}but thank you so much for joining us on Minecraft.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:13.13,0:28:14.97,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}一如既往 我是说 完整版在我们的Patreon上
Dialogue: 2,0:28:13.13,0:28:14.97,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}As always, I mean, the full versions on our Patreon.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:15.39,0:28:16.41,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我是说 谢谢你的加入
Dialogue: 2,0:28:15.39,0:28:16.41,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}I mean, thanks for joining us.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:16.45,0:28:16.87,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}谢谢
Dialogue: 2,0:28:16.45,0:28:16.87,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:17.25,0:28:18.17,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}非常感谢
Dialogue: 2,0:28:17.25,0:28:18.17,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:18.67,0:28:19.43,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}下次见
Dialogue: 2,0:28:18.67,0:28:19.43,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Until next time.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:19.55,0:28:19.85,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}再见
Dialogue: 2,0:28:19.55,0:28:19.85,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}Bye bye.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:20.05,0:28:20.37,CN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}回头见
Dialogue: 2,0:28:20.05,0:28:20.37,EN-1080,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}See ya.
